Example 16 — Auto-augmented internal basis presets
=================================================

Demonstrates the ``"minimal"`` and ``"extended"`` string presets
accepted by ``PAOFLOW.projections(..., configuration=...)``.

The example reuses the QE outputs produced by ``example10`` (GaAs):

  1) Run example10 first to generate ``example10/GaAs.save``.
  2) From this directory, run ``python main.py``.

The script prints ``nawf`` and the number of high-projectability bands
for three configurations:

  * the original hand-written shell list (manual),
  * the ``"minimal"`` preset (UPF valence only),
  * the ``"extended"`` preset (minimal + rule-based polarization).

The ``"extended"`` preset should give nawf >= "minimal" nawf and at
least as many bands above the projectability threshold.

Override the GaAs.save location via the ``PAOFLOW_GAAS_SAVEDIR``
environment variable if needed.
